{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f01655964a19de6e4c98a79557eb7e804d6a2f5b6ed5166bd4fdb067db3c7155", "ja": "（まつりに新しい衣装を試着してもらった。まつりの\n新曲をイメージしてみたが、気に入ってくれたかな？）", "zh": "（让茉莉试穿了新服装。试着融入她新歌的意象，不知道她喜不喜欢呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "536fb981abfb30332f6e56ca430e6f8e4e8e021b871a9341bff15f10fc253443", "ja": "びゅーてぃふぉー！なのです。\nさすが、{$P$}さんなのです。", "zh": "太漂亮了！  \n不愧是{$P$}先生呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "2c0976109cc019de79463a7063620e9c5303a810189bde1942c7f7688bba1481", "ja": "まつりが思い描いていた、キラキラ！な夢と憧れが\nたっぷり詰まった素敵なドレスなのですよ♪", "zh": "这是一件满载着玛茨莉心中描绘的、闪闪发光的梦想与憧憬的漂亮礼服哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f35a44c777f2e02c6a19506a00b34edb2cc5660aaea9608afafd62e262aa11d0", "ja": "喜んでもらえたみたいでよかったよ。\nうん。よく似合ってるよ、まつり。", "zh": "你能喜欢就太好了。\n嗯，很适合你哦，茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "24881e26de6f8487d973bf13646d91c513c965bd7ab38ba78faba973768c60a4", "ja": "ありがとうなのです♪\nでも不思議なのです、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "谢谢你♪\n不过真不可思议呢，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "59f3aa97d4a8b6c832a92f3b2c2bed5f611c577f4d169e403ff392b683edd044", "ja": "この衣装を着たら、\n姫は魔法にかかったような気がするのです。", "zh": "穿上这身服装后，\n小公主感觉自己好像中了魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e8f9c152f0029752f874628d5f79f70f2a38588ec4c4cc6d51327425edd9d825", "ja": "魔法か……。もしかしたら、\nその衣装は魔法使いが用意したものかもしれないな。", "zh": "魔法吗……。说不定，那件服装就是魔法师准备的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "ffc18dcd0193e3ac60536d2b38301f668d9700070216048b8631f55162adce5b", "ja": "なるほど……。{$P$}さんは、\n魔法使いさんとお友達なのですね！", "zh": "原来如此……。{$P$}先生是魔法师先生的朋友呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "67abaaf73afc08fffee471c1953dd2022adcfe53f55ca3f9842066b7b77c8d14", "ja": "姫、どうしても魔法使いさんにお願いがあるのです！\n伝言をお願いしたいのです！", "zh": "公主无论如何都有个愿望想请魔法使先生帮忙！\n想拜托您代为传话呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ca888c3c38dd284c10445a5d423fd6928977c1f925e9d25f3d491968426ca166", "ja": "伝言ならお安い御用だ！\nそれで、何を伝えればいいんだ？", "zh": "要捎口信是吧，小事一桩！\n那么，要我传达什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "69b08090444b3afafa73c6d2af6464cc6d2b3f5080d7d83fb8a1910a5cb73f94", "ja": "とっても簡単なのです。\n姫が魔法使いさんにお願いしたいことは……", "zh": "非常简单哦。公主想拜托魔法师先生的事情是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "70b1aeffd0aa18a0d0d69b70b6afeba13ea769b7c52bcdb5ddac063b48fa7842", "ja": "いつか、姫の魔法が解ける時が来たら……。\nまつりを、そっと見守っていてほしいのです。", "zh": "总有一天，如果公主的魔法到了该解除的时候……  \n希望您能静静地守望着小祭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1ee3b12b0959759c1b03948fdc4a359c46633f14b8012adc51004aeefc4c6108", "ja": "……その願いは伝えられないな。", "zh": "……这个愿望，我可没法帮你转达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "2dd31cb0521f0e1703767df723d8ab9351881073fedaa4159d89af7944882d75", "ja": "ほ？　どうしてなのです？", "zh": "哦？为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_1014", "source_sha256": "4120e4b58bd14abce0ac7c5a8e5efcb7a0dc0bc0fc0c1428dcff1c5544d303d3", "ja": "魔法は解けない！", "zh": "魔法不会解除！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ee1639d96c03755ce98a6f0fc19abf43f5f2040576b031ad755830596f8d1e02", "ja": "まつりにかかった魔法は解けないよ。それに\nこの劇場のお姫様は、まつりにしか務まらないからな。", "zh": "施在茉莉身上的魔法是不会解开的。而且，\n这个剧场的公主殿下，也只有茉莉才胜任得了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2001_021mat", "source_sha256": "f2147cb08ffbbcfcc7016c7b0d5533e4c0e5ec073af49ee4b4fc43c2fc5a6973", "ja": "……ふふっ。{$P$}さん、\n姫はお願いを変えるのです。", "zh": "……呵呵。{$P$}先生，\n公主决定要换一个愿望了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "242ec1974e96a0be269e08ee06d7ede1a9d39810cbc76f08441820c92c99eeb1", "ja": "この先もずっと、みんなを笑顔に変えられるように……\n姫に魔法をかけ続けてほしいのです♪", "zh": "希望你今后也一直给公主施展魔法，让公主能永远让大家绽放笑容……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2003_p", "source_sha256": "424df8ffe28779d5cb0b352bba8ecfa366f042c7e30bb66a1a3403fcc68cc47f", "ja": "ははっ。わかった。\nまつりの願い、ちゃんと魔法使いに伝えておくよ。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。我会把茉莉的愿望好好转告给魔法师的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2004_021mat", "source_sha256": "a2b01fc6552b139e246e360a4c528a0f1647b3f98ccd3cefaad11a69c5e403fd", "ja": "ありがとうなのです。これでまつり姫のぱわーも増えて\nみんな、とびきり・はっぴー！になるのです！", "zh": "谢谢你。这样一来茉莉公主的力量也增强了，\n大家都会变得超——级幸福的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2005_021mat", "source_sha256": "0660bf3b6d21fb1bcc7eb14bb938711cf15e37fda19bf2680cb428150549e72d", "ja": "これからの姫の活躍に乞うご期待、なのですよ！\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "敬请期待今后公主的精彩表现哦！\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2006_p", "source_sha256": "e02fe6cd6797b922702b9e93686cce0d12bbe81f98591aa7eb44f2b3f3f052c8", "ja": "（魔法の効果は永遠ではないかもしれない……。\nでも、お姫様の願いを叶えるのがプロデューサーだ）", "zh": "（魔法的效果或许并不是永恒的……但让公主的愿望实现，正是制作人的职责。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0444_2007_p", "source_sha256": "5be614b4a58680980bd02f262c69ae23c2ff4e093f6390338d8fddb904d26796", "ja": "（お姫様が望む限り、何度だって魔法をかけよう。\nどんな時もステージで一番輝くのはお姫様だからな！）", "zh": "（只要公主有所期望，我就会无数次为她施展魔法。\n因为无论何时，在舞台上闪耀最夺目的都是公主！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
